---
import PageShell from "@layouts/PageShell.astro";
import PageHeader from "@components/ui/PageHeader.astro";
import { site, whatsappUrl, localizedPath } from "@config/site";

const locale = "en" as const;
const c = site.brand;
const wa = whatsappUrl();
const avisoHref = localizedPath("/aviso-de-privacidad", locale);
const cancelacionHref = localizedPath("/politica-de-cancelacion", locale);
const restriccionesHref = localizedPath("/politicas-y-restricciones", locale);
---

<PageShell
  title="Terms and conditions"
  description="How Aerodiverti operates: bookings, payment, the day of the flight, safety restrictions and add-ons."
  logicalPath="/terminos-y-condiciones"
  activeId=""
>
  <PageHeader
    title="Terms and conditions"
    lead="The flight depends on the weather, there are non-negotiable safety restrictions, and the price you see is the price you pay."
  />

  <article class="legal container-narrow">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>

    <p class="legal-lead">
      Booking on this site means you accept the following. The essentials: the flight depends on
      the weather, there are non-negotiable safety restrictions, and the price you see is the one
      charged, with no booking fees.
    </p>

    <h2>The service</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} operates hot-air balloon flights over the Teotihuacán valley, taking off from
      the Aerodiverti launch site in {c.address.area}. Flights are run by crew licensed by the
      aviation authority (AFAC) and the activity includes traveler insurance.
    </p>

    <h2>Bookings and payment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The booking is confirmed once payment is completed. Until then, the seat is not held.</li>
      <li>The price shown is the total: no booking fees or commissions are added at the end.</li>
      <li>Prices are in Mexican pesos.</li>
      <li>Payment is processed by Stripe and PayPal. We do not store card details.</li>
      <li>
        Book at least one day ahead: the flight leaves at sunrise and the manifest closes the
        night before.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The day of the flight</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Arrive at the time shown on your boarding pass. That is the check-in time, before takeoff.
      </li>
      <li>The exact takeoff time depends on the weather and is set by the captain.</li>
      <li>The flight lasts 45 to 60 minutes, subject to wind conditions.</li>
      <li>The landing point is decided by the wind: it is not a fixed location.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Safety restrictions</h2>
    <p>
      The minimum age to fly is 4 years or 1.10 m tall, and every minor flies accompanied by an
      adult: holding them during the flight is not allowed. Pregnant people cannot fly. The
      pilot in command may deny boarding to anyone not fit to fly safely. These restrictions admit
      no exception and create no additional liability for Aerodiverti beyond what the
      <a href={cancelacionHref}>cancellation policy</a> provides. The full list is in
      <a href={restriccionesHref}>flight policies and restrictions</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Cancellations and changes</h2>
    <p>
      These are governed by the <a href={cancelacionHref}>cancellation policy</a>, which is part of
      these terms. If the weather makes it unsafe to fly, we reschedule your flight at no cost.
    </p>

    <h2>Add-ons</h2>
    <p>
      Photos, drone video, breakfast and transport are optional services booked together with the
      flight. If the flight is cancelled due to weather, the related add-ons are refunded or
      rescheduled with it.
    </p>

    <h2>Site content</h2>
    <p>
      The photographs, text and trademarks on this site are the property of {site.name} and may
      not be reproduced without authorization.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact and clarifications</h2>
    <p>
      For any clarification, message us on
      <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or at
      <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>. See also our
      <a href={avisoHref}>privacy notice</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="legal-contact">
      Questions about this document? Message us on
      <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or at
      <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: var(--space-md) var(--space-3xl);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .legal-lead {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .legal-contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
